# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improve an SQD estimate with orbital optimization for the latest version of Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"
msgstr "Perbaiki anggaran SQD dengan pengoptimuman orbital untuk versi terkini Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Improve an SQD estimate with orbital optimization"
msgstr "Perbaiki anggaran SQD dengan pengoptimuman orbital"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"addons/qiskit-addon-sqd/guides/optimize-orbitals.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD) approximates a ground-state energy by\n"
"diagonalizing the Hamiltonian in a fixed subspace of electronic configurations. That\n"
"estimate depends on the orbital basis in which the Hamiltonian is expressed, and\n"
"*orbital optimization* (OO) exploits this freedom to lower the energy without enlarging\n"
"the subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sample-based quantum diagonalization (SQD) menganggar tenaga keadaan asas dengan\n"
"mempepenjurukan Hamiltonian dalam subruang tetap konfigurasi elektronik. Anggaran\n"
"itu bergantung pada asas orbital yang digunakan untuk menyatakan Hamiltonian, dan\n"
"*pengoptimuman orbital* (OO) memanfaatkan kebebasan ini untuk merendahkan tenaga tanpa membesarkan\n"
"subruang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This guide runs SQD on an $N_2$ molecule and then improves the result with orbital\n"
"optimization, using [`ffsim`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) to represent\n"
"the Hamiltonian and find the energy-minimizing orbital rotation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Panduan ini menjalankan SQD pada molekul $N_2$ dan kemudian memperbaiki hasilnya dengan pengoptimuman\n"
"orbital, menggunakan [`ffsim`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/) untuk mewakili\n"
"Hamiltonian dan mencari putaran orbital yang meminimumkan tenaga.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Run SQD {#run-sqd}"
msgstr "Jalankan SQD {#run-sqd}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We build the molecular integrals for $N_2$ in the molecular-orbital (MO) basis, generate\n"
"uniform random samples, and run SQD to obtain a ground-state approximation.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami membina kamiran molekul untuk $N_2$ dalam asas orbital molekul (MO), menjana\n"
"sampel rawak seragam, dan menjalankan SQD untuk memperoleh penghampiran keadaan asas.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Optimize the orbitals {#optimize-the-orbitals}"
msgstr "Optimumkan orbital {#optimize-the-orbitals}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Orbital optimization searches for an orbital rotation that lowers the variational energy\n"
msgstr "Pengoptimuman orbital mencari putaran orbital yang merendahkan tenaga variasi\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"E = \\langle \\psi | \\mathcal{U}^\\dagger\\, H\\, \\mathcal{U} | \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"E = \\langle \\psi | \\mathcal{U}^\\dagger\\, H\\, \\mathcal{U} | \\psi \\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"of the SQD ground-state approximation $|\\psi\\rangle$. An orbital rotation is specified by\n"
"an $N \\times N$ unitary matrix $\\mathbf{U}$ ($N$ is the number of spatial orbitals), which\n"
"acts on the many-body state through the operator\n"
msgstr ""
"bagi penghampiran keadaan asas SQD $|\\psi\\rangle$. Putaran orbital ditentukan oleh\n"
"matriks uniter $N \\times N$ $\\mathbf{U}$ ($N$ ialah bilangan orbital ruang), yang\n"
"bertindak pada keadaan banyak jasad melalui operator\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U} = \\exp\\left[\\sum_{pq, \\sigma} \\log(\\mathbf{U})_{pq}\\, a^\\dagger_{p\\sigma} a_{q\\sigma}\\right].\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"\\mathcal{U} = \\exp\\left[\\sum_{pq, \\sigma} \\log(\\mathbf{U})_{pq}\\, a^\\dagger_{p\\sigma} a_{q\\sigma}\\right].\n"
"$$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"`ffsim.optimize_orbitals` returns the **matrix** $\\mathbf{U}$, and applying it to the\n"
"orbital basis (via `hamiltonian.rotated`) is equivalent to applying $\\mathcal{U}$ to the\n"
"state. See the\n"
"[ffsim orbital-rotation explanation](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/explanations/orbital-rotation.html)\n"
"for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"`ffsim.optimize_orbitals` memulangkan **matriks** $\\mathbf{U}$, dan menggunakannya pada\n"
"asas orbital (melalui `hamiltonian.rotated`) setara dengan menggunakan $\\mathcal{U}$ pada\n"
"keadaan. Lihat\n"
"[penjelasan putaran orbital ffsim](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/explanations/orbital-rotation.html)\n"
"untuk butiran.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Since rotating the orbitals changes the Hamiltonian seen by the subspace, we alternate\n"
"two steps until the energy stops improving:\n"
msgstr ""
"Oleh sebab memutar orbital mengubah Hamiltonian yang dilihat oleh subruang, kami berselang-seli\n"
"dua langkah sehingga tenaga berhenti bertambah baik:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Diagonalize** the Hamiltonian in the current basis over the fixed set of\n"
"configurations.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Pepenjuruan** Hamiltonian dalam asas semasa ke atas set konfigurasi\n"
"yang tetap.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Optimize the orbitals** by finding the rotation that minimizes the energy of the\n"
"resulting state, then rotate the integrals into the new basis.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Optimumkan orbital** dengan mencari putaran yang meminimumkan tenaga bagi\n"
"keadaan yang terhasil, kemudian putarkan kamiran ke dalam asas baharu.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We delegate the orbital-rotation step to\n"
"[`ffsim.optimize_orbitals`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/ffsim.html#ffsim.optimize_orbitals),\n"
"which finds the energy-minimizing rotation from the one- and two-body reduced density\n"
"matrices (RDMs) of the state. See\n"
"[Sec. II A 4](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.05068) for details.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami menyerahkan langkah putaran orbital kepada\n"
"[`ffsim.optimize_orbitals`](https://qiskit-community.github.io/ffsim/api/ffsim.html#ffsim.optimize_orbitals),\n"
"yang mencari putaran peminimum tenaga daripada matriks ketumpatan terturun (RDM)\n"
"satu dan dua jasad bagi keadaan itu. Lihat\n"
"[Sek. II A 4](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2405.05068) untuk butiran.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why orbital optimization helps here {#why-orbital-optimization-helps-here}"
msgstr "Mengapa pengoptimuman orbital membantu di sini {#why-orbital-optimization-helps-here}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The SCF molecular-orbital (MO) basis is stationary with respect to orbital rotations\n"
"for the *full*-CI problem. But SQD works in a small truncated subspace (here a few\n"
"hundred CI strings out of roughly 19 million full-CI determinants), for which the MO\n"
"basis is generally not optimal, so rotating the orbitals lowers the energy the subspace\n"
"can represent.\n"
msgstr ""
"Asas orbital molekul (MO) SCF bersifat pegun terhadap putaran orbital\n"
"bagi masalah CI *penuh*. Tetapi SQD bekerja dalam subruang terpangkas yang kecil (di sini beberapa\n"
"ratus rentetan CI daripada kira-kira 19 juta penentu CI penuh), yang mana asas\n"
"MO secara amnya tidak optimum, jadi memutar orbital merendahkan tenaga yang boleh\n"
"diwakili oleh subruang.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Alternate diagonalization and orbital optimization {#alternate-diagonalization-and-orbital-optimization}"
msgstr "Berselang-seli antara pepenjuruan dan pengoptimuman orbital {#alternate-diagonalization-and-orbital-optimization}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We keep the diagonalization subspace **fixed** to the configurations discovered by SQD\n"
"above, so that each iteration isolates the effect of rotating the orbitals. Each\n"
"iteration:\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami mengekalkan subruang pepenjuruan **tetap** pada konfigurasi yang ditemui oleh SQD\n"
"di atas, supaya setiap lelaran mengasingkan kesan memutar orbital. Setiap\n"
"lelaran:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Diagonalizes** the Hamiltonian over the fixed subspace in the current basis, using\n"
"PySCF's selected-CI solver.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mempepenjurukan** Hamiltonian ke atas subruang tetap dalam asas semasa, menggunakan\n"
"penyelesai CI terpilih PySCF.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Builds the RDMs** of the resulting state, which is all `ffsim.optimize_orbitals`\n"
"needs.\n"
msgstr "**Membina RDM** bagi keadaan yang terhasil, iaitu semua yang diperlukan oleh `ffsim.optimize_orbitals`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Optimizes the orbitals**: `ffsim.optimize_orbitals` returns the energy-minimizing\n"
"rotation, which we apply to the integrals to move into the improved basis.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Mengoptimumkan orbital**: `ffsim.optimize_orbitals` memulangkan putaran peminimum\n"
"tenaga, yang kami gunakan pada kamiran untuk beralih ke asas yang diperbaiki.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We record the energy *before* each optimization step. Because the basis improves every\n"
"iteration, this sequence decreases monotonically toward the best energy achievable in\n"
"the fixed subspace.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami merekodkan tenaga *sebelum* setiap langkah pengoptimuman. Oleh sebab asas bertambah baik pada setiap\n"
"lelaran, jujukan ini menurun secara monoton menuju tenaga terbaik yang boleh dicapai dalam\n"
"subruang tetap.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Compare the results {#compare-the-results}"
msgstr "Bandingkan keputusan {#compare-the-results}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Orbital optimization improves the fixed-subspace estimate, closing much of the gap to\n"
"the exact energy while staying above it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Pengoptimuman orbital memperbaiki anggaran subruang tetap, merapatkan sebahagian besar jurang kepada\n"
"tenaga tepat sambil kekal di atasnya.\n"
